{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Deviation","html":"<article id='sn1.58'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Saṁyutta Nikāya 1.58 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Linked Discourses 1.58 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>6. Jarāvagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>6. Old Age </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Uppathasutta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Deviation </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Kiṁsu uppatho akkhāto, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>“What’s declared to be a deviation? </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>kiṁsu rattindivakkhayo; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>What is ending day and night? </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Kiṁ malaṁ brahmacariyassa, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>What’s the stain of chastity? </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>kiṁ sinānamanodakan”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>What’s the waterless bath?” </span></span></p>\n<p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Rāgo uppatho akkhāto, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>“Lust is declared to be a deviation. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Vayo rattindivakkhayo; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Youth is ending day and night. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Itthī malaṁ brahmacariyassa, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Women are the stain of chastity, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Etthāyaṁ sajjate pajā; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>to which this generation clings. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Tapo ca brahmacariyañca, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Fervor and chastity </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Taṁ sinānamanodakan”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>are the waterless bath.” </span></span></p></blockquote></article>"}
